 Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link current\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 12 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 12 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 12 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"প্রতিটি difference বা pattern আপনার ধারণার effect নয়। Systematic bias, random error, measurement error ও confounding practical example দিয়ে শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Not every difference or pattern is the effect you think it is. Learn systematic bias, random error, measurement error, and confounding through practical examples.\">Not every difference or pattern is the effect you think it is. Learn systematic bias, random error, measurement error, and confounding through practical examples.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 50 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Bias ও random error আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Distinguish bias from random error.\">Distinguish bias from random error.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Selection, measurement ও response bias চিনুন।\" data-en=\"Recognize selection, measurement, and response bias.\">Recognize selection, measurement, and response bias.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Confounding explain করুন।\" data-en=\"Explain confounding.\">Explain confounding.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Avoidable error কমানোর check design করুন।\" data-en=\"Design checks that reduce avoidable error.\">Design checks that reduce avoidable error.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Bias ও random error\" data-en=\"Bias and random error\">Bias and random error</h2><p data-bn=\"Bias হলো result truth থেকে specific direction-এ systematically differ করার tendency। Random error truth-এর চারদিকে unpredictable variation তৈরি করে। Larger sample random sampling error কমায়, systematic bias automatically remove করে না।\" data-en=\"Bias is a systematic tendency for results to differ from the truth in a particular direction. Random error creates unpredictable variation around the truth. Larger samples usually reduce random sampling error, but they do not automatically remove systematic bias.\">Bias is a systematic tendency for results to differ from the truth in a particular direction. Random error creates unpredictable variation around the truth. Larger samples usually reduce random sampling error, but they do not automatically remove systematic bias.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Bias-এর source\" data-en=\"Sources of bias\">Sources of bias</h2><p data-bn=\"Selection bias-এ included observation excluded group থেকে systematically differ করে। Measurement bias instrument বা definition থেকে। Response bias wording, social desirability, memory বা interviewer effect থেকে। Survivorship bias observation-এর আগে disappear করা case ignore করে।\" data-en=\"Selection bias occurs when included observations differ systematically from those excluded. Measurement bias arises from instruments or definitions. Response bias occurs when answers are influenced by wording, social desirability, memory, or interviewer effects. Survivorship bias ignores cases that disappeared before observation.\">Selection bias occurs when included observations differ systematically from those excluded. Measurement bias arises from instruments or definitions. Response bias occurs when answers are influenced by wording, social desirability, memory, or interviewer effects. Survivorship bias ignores cases that disappeared before observation.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Confounding\" data-en=\"Confounding\">Confounding</h2><p data-bn=\"Confounder suspected cause ও outcome উভয়ের সঙ্গে associated হয়ে observed relationship তৈরি বা distort করে। Ice-cream sale ও drowning hot weather-এর কারণে একসঙ্গে বাড়তে পারে। Association causation identify করে না।\" data-en=\"A confounder is associated with both the suspected cause and the outcome, creating or distorting an observed relationship. For example, ice-cream sales and drowning may rise together because hot weather affects both. Association alone does not identify causation.\">A confounder is associated with both the suspected cause and the outcome, creating or distorting an observed relationship. For example, ice-cream sales and drowning may rise together because hot weather affects both. Association alone does not identify causation.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-4\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">04</div><h2 data-bn=\"Error sampling-এর চেয়ে বড়\" data-en=\"Error is broader than sampling\">Error is broader than sampling</h2><p data-bn=\"Processing mistake, duplicate record, incorrect join, time-zone conversion, coding change ও data-entry problem result alter করতে পারে। Analyst-এর প্রতিটি stage-এ validation check প্রয়োজন, শুধু শেষে statistical formula নয়।\" data-en=\"Processing mistakes, duplicate records, incorrect joins, time-zone conversions, coding changes, and data entry problems can also alter results. Analysts need validation checks at each stage, not only statistical formulas at the end.\">Processing mistakes, duplicate records, incorrect joins, time-zone conversions, coding changes, and data entry problems can also alter results. Analysts need validation checks at each stage, not only statistical formulas at the end.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Bias\" data-en=\"Bias\">Bias</h3><p data-bn=\"Truth বা target quantity থেকে systematic deviation।\" data-en=\"Systematic deviation from the truth or target quantity.\">Systematic deviation from the truth or target quantity.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Random error\" data-en=\"Random error\">Random error</h3><p data-bn=\"Chance process-এর unpredictable variation।\" data-en=\"Unpredictable variation caused by chance processes.\">Unpredictable variation caused by chance processes.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Confounder\" data-en=\"Confounder\">Confounder</h3><p data-bn=\"Exposure ও outcome উভয়ের সঙ্গে related variable যা association distort করে।\" data-en=\"A variable related to both an exposure and outcome that distorts their association.\">A variable related to both an exposure and outcome that distorts their association.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Measurement error\" data-en=\"Measurement error\">Measurement error</h3><p data-bn=\"Recorded value ও intended quantity-এর difference।\" data-en=\"Difference between a recorded value and the intended quantity.\">Difference between a recorded value and the intended quantity.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Training ও employee performance\" data-en=\"Training and employee performance\">Training and employee performance</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"Optional training attend করা employee-এর performance score বেশি।\" data-en=\"Employees who attended optional training have higher performance scores.\">Employees who attended optional training have higher performance scores.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Association descriptive।\" data-en=\"The association is descriptive.\">The association is descriptive.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Training attendance randomly assigned ছিল না।\" data-en=\"Training attendance was not randomly assigned.\">Training attendance was not randomly assigned.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"More motivated বা experienced employee attend করার chance বেশি।\" data-en=\"More motivated or experienced employees may be more likely to attend.\">More motivated or experienced employees may be more likely to attend.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Manager support attendance ও performance উভয়কে affect করতে পারে।\" data-en=\"Manager support may affect both attendance and performance.\">Manager support may affect both attendance and performance.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Causal claim-এর আগে baseline performance, role, experience ও assignment process compare করুন।\" data-en=\"Compare baseline performance, role, experience, and assignment process before causal claims.\">Compare baseline performance, role, experience, and assignment process before causal claims.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Data association support করে; training difference cause করেছে তা prove করে না।\" data-en=\"The data support an association, not proof that training caused the difference.\">The data support an association, not proof that training caused the difference.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Bias systematic; random error chance variation।\" data-en=\"Bias is systematic; random error is chance variation.\">Bias is systematic; random error is chance variation.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Large sample systematic bias cure করে না।\" data-en=\"Large samples do not cure systematic bias.\">Large samples do not cure systematic bias.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Confounding misleading association তৈরি করতে পারে।\" data-en=\"Confounding can create misleading associations.\">Confounding can create misleading associations.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Validation পুরো data workflow cover করবে।\" data-en=\"Validation must cover the full data workflow.\">Validation must cover the full data workflow.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-2-data-sampling-and-variation-in-data-and-sampling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenStax — Data, Sampling, and Variation ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/ppc/section4/ppc41.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST/SEMATECH — First Steps in Data Analysis ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}